OL,3,GNEWSASafety fears remain for some using
OL,4,Apublic transport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Fhas said "people still don't feel safe"
OL,8,Fon a region's public transport system.
OL,10,FNorthumbria PCC Susan Dungworth said
OL,11,Falthough reports of anti-social
OL,12,Fbehaviour have fallen by 10%, some,
OL,13,Fincluding women and people with
OL,14,Fdisabilities, were uneasy when it came
OL,15,Fto travelling.
OL,17,FBetween April 2025 and March, more than
OL,18,F1,000 incidents were reported to
OL,19,FNorthumbria Police across the public
OL,20,Ftransport network.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
