OL,3,GNEWSASafety fears remain for some using
OL,4,Apublic transport
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo tackle this, the Safer Transport
OL,7,FNorthumbria Partnership has been
OL,8,Flaunched to bring together Northumbria
OL,9,FPolice, the PCC, North East Mayor Kim
OL,10,FMcGuinness, Metro operator Nexus and
OL,11,Flocal bus companies.
